---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profilePageSchema } from '../lib/schema';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About MD Anik Hasan | Founder and Software Builder"
  description="MD Anik Hasan is a Computer Science and Engineering student at United International University who builds full-stack web products, custom software, and Boilabin."
  schema={profilePageSchema()}
>
  <section class="about-composition" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h1 id="about-title">About</h1>
    <article class="prose about-story">
      <p class="about-label">Hey.</p>
      <p class="about-lead">I’m 22. I make websites and software. There’s also a language model in the works, so that keeps me busy.</p>

      <p class="studio-bengali" lang="bn">নতুন কিছু বানাতে মজা লাগে। এই সাইটে সেগুলোই রাখছি।</p>
      <p>
        I built Boilabin and run it too. SoctuKit and the UIU Discord Bot are mine as well.
        You can find them all in <a href="/work/">Works</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Salty Potato AI is the language model. I’m building the tokenizer, training setup, and
        desktop app myself. It’s still in progress.
      </p>

      <p>
        I’m into projects that give me something new to try. If you have an idea for one,
        I’m happy to hear it.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/contact/">Get in touch ↗</a>
      </p>

    <aside class="content-rail" aria-label="Profile summary">
      <div>
        <p class="rail-label">Based in</p>
        <p>Dhaka, Bangladesh</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="rail-label">Studying</p>
        <p>Computer Science and Engineering at UIU</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="rail-label">Currently building</p>
        <p>Boilabin, SoctuKit, UIU Discord Bot, and Salty Potato AI</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
